Interactability_Text_Line_0 Log 17/5/17 - Research Outpost: Alpha
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ------
Interactability_Text_Line_2 We’ve recently received orders to start construction of a bunker in the recently dubbed “Giant Chasm”. An odd request especially due to the fact that it’s an active lava and thermal zone, but orders are orders.